    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24060" root="صدى" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَادٍ</span></b>  (fem. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>, and pl. of the latter <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَوَادٍ</span>):
see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَدٍ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  As pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَادِيَةٌ</span>, (M,) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَوَادٍ</span> signifies
[also] <i>Tall</i> palm-trees: (S, K:) and sometimes,
<i>such as drink not water:</i> (S:) or palm-trees <i>that
drink water:</i> [thus in a copy of the M:] and
some say, <i>such as are tall</i> thereof, and of other
trees. (M.)

